{{Quote|In order to ensure the security and continuing stability, the Republic will be reorganized into the first Galactic Empire! For a safe and secure society!|Sheev Palpatine|audio=Palpatine-Proclamation.flac|<ref name="Episode III" />}}
The '''proclamation of the New Order''' was the event that marked the founding of the [[Galactic Empire]]. At the end of the [[Clone Wars]], during an emergency session of the [[Galactic Senate]], [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]]&mdash;secretly [[Darth]] Sidious, the [[Dark Lord of the Sith]]&mdash;claimed that the [[Jedi Order]] had attempted to overthrow the [[Galactic Republic]]. The [[Jedi]] were declared enemies of the Republic, and Sidious transformed it into the first Galactic Empire, with himself as [[Galactic Emperor|absolute ruler]]. The proclamation was met with widespread support in the Senate<ref name="Episode III" /> and in public,<ref name="Palpatine Databank">{{Databank|emperor-palpatine-darth-sidious|Emperor Palpatine/Darth Sidious}}</ref> though some&mdash;such as [[Senator]]s [[Bail Prestor Organa|Bail Organa]] and [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] quietly watched in disappointment.<ref name="Episode III" /> [[Empire Day]] was an annual holiday that celebrated the declaration of the [[New Order]].<ref name="Empire Day" />

Trillions of citizens of [[the galaxy]] heard Palpatine's proclamation of the New Order.<ref name="Battles">''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]''</ref>

